"P748183373" "It sounds to me as if Crey was mucking about with Rikti technology again, and they got themselves in over their heads. Once Crey set up those portals, the Rikti were able to access them from their own bases. I hesitate to think what the Rikti would have done with the contents of that Crey lab at their disposal. Their limited resources are the only thing keeping the alien invaders in check."
