// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3471051799" "{HeroName}, I think you may have just stopped a mass murder. It sounds to me like Crey tried to wipe out that entire neighborhood and make it look like an accident, just so they could hide the fact that they polluted the area. Normally, this would be a public relations nightmare for Crey, but, as usual, the countess managed to spin it her way. Her story is that Crey security located a leaky sewer pipe and were rounding up civilians for their own safety."
// RandomFameString :
"P3709017944" "My whole neighborhood has {HeroName} to thank for our lives!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P874269987" "Are you ready for the whole, ugly story, {HeroName}? It looks like Crey was dumping toxic waste in that area, and a number of the residents wound up sick. Rather than owning up to the problem, Crey tried to wipe out an entire neighborhood! Most of the people got away, but a few are still missing. I'll put some of my other heroes on it; maybe we can find those people before it's too late."
// RandomFameString :
"P3922807646" "I haven't seen my dad since Crey security started investigating a sewer leak in his neighborhood."

