"P281409739" "I've got a good lead on a Crey lab that's linked to the countess' sick Revenant Hero Project. I don't want to get your hopes up, {HeroName}, but my sources tell me Countess Crey herself is a frequent visitor to the lab. If you can find any evidence linking her to that lab, it'll be hard for her to maintain her plausible deniability. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to investigate that Crey lab right away.</A> This could be big!"
// AcceptString :
"P3233763429" "Investigate the Crey lab"
// SendOffString :
"P2763166483" "Dirt never seems to stick to the countess. Maybe you can change that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P167762195" "Defeat all forces in lab"
