// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WarrenStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2504220399" "Warren Lyte's story"
// DetailString :
"P493190555" "When you rescued Warren Lyte, he told you:<br><br>'I noticed something was wrong with Shiny a couple of weeks ago. She just didn't seem herself. I started questioning her, trying to figure out what was wrong. That was my mistake.<br><br>'It's hard for me to believe, but she's just not my Shiny anymore. Crey's changed her in some way! She's the one who had me kidnapped. I think they would have killed me if you hadn't shown up!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2969796730" "{HeroName}, have you ever worked with a hero called the Shining Light? She's a powerful blaster who I give tips to from time to time. Well, her husband's gone missing! Naturally, Shiny's worried sick. I don't want to scare her, but an eyewitness saw her husband being dragged into a Crey facility! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you rescue Warren Lyte from Crey?</A> I'm sure Shiny'd do the same for your family."
// AcceptString :
"P2309383183" "Rescue Warren Lyte from Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P2475167908" "The Shining Light has been keeping her eye on Crey corruption lately. Maybe they kidnapped her husband as retaliation."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2692624642" "Stop Protectors' leader & her men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3702504435" "I don't know what Crey wants with Warren Lyte, but I'm sure he won't find it pleasant!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P514245502" "Fragments of a glass beaker lie on the ground. Perhaps Warren Lyte put up a struggle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3475745300" "The Shining Light"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3637265247" "HQ wants my hubby disposed of. A pity."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1739383028" "{HeroName} knows too much!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Warren 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2014192692" "Warren Lyte"
// Description :
"P4211882866" "Rescue Warren Lyte"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P171579830" "You've got to know what happened to my wife!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P818300481" "You rescued Warren Lyte from Crey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1990185186" "Well, Warren will be in protective custody for a while. He's pretty shaken up, and I don't blame him. It sounds as though Crey got their hands on the Shining Light's DNA and used it to construct an imposter. If Shiny's husband wasn't so observant, it might have worked, too. I don't know whether the real Shining Light is dead, or trapped in a Crey facility somewhere. I hope someday we can learn the truth, for her husband's sake."
// RandomFameString :
"P2621885105" "What ever happened to the Shining Light? She used to be a real presence in this town."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Count 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3217737733" "File on Count Crey"
// DetailString :
"P198586054" "This file, dating back many years, contains detailed information about Count Crey's blood samples, REM patterns, and responses to stimuli. Your eyes are drawn to a note scrawled in the margin of the final page: 'As predicted, the nerve agent has been completely effective. It is unlikely that I could cure him, even if I tried.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1466542281" "Guess who I just got a call from! Countess Crey's in-laws! They're desperate, and they thought we might be able to help them. See, Countess Crey's been keeping her husband in a well-guarded medical facility ever since he fell into a coma years ago. She won't let anyone but her private doctors see him; as far as his relatives know, he may not even be alive anymore! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They hoped you could find some evidence of the count's continued existence.</A> Anything that would let them know he's still alive."
// AcceptString :
"P2561855221" "Find some evidence of the count's continued existence"
// SendOffString :
"P311382095" "Those people deserve whatever comfort we can give them. Hurry back, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1455155953" "Find evidence about Count Crey"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1672107826" "Count Crey's relatives still don't know anything about his status."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3706601655" "The impassive rhythm of medical equipment seems to give this building an eerie pulse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2363702483" "Has the count been moved?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3019700065" "Yes, he's safe in the Gamma facility."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2113763481" "This is a medical facility! You're not sterile!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4105117061" "Computer"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1231387830" "You begin to access the files."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1993621636" "You have accessed the files."
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4122395291" "You found a file on Count Crey!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1703596580" "You found some evidence about the count's disease."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P493512896" "From the sound of that file, there's nothing natural about Count Crey's coma. The countess is keeping him sick, so that she can pull all the strings at Crey Industries. {HeroName}, I've heard a lot of sad stories on this job, but this one really takes the cake. I hope someday we can find Count Crey and restore him to the man he once was."
// RandomFameString :
"P3984780519" "Countess Crey is such an angel! Her husband's been in a coma for ages, but she still hasn't given up on him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ScientistStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3575718284" "The scientist's story"
// DetailString :
"P2434755622" "One of the Crey scientists you rescued told you:<br><br>'This all started when we got our hands on a Rikti bio-morphing chamber. It was booby trapped, but the countess wanted it researched anyway. We were able to use the technology to improve the Paragon Protectors somewhat, but we lost eight scientists and 17 Protectors in the process! No matter how many died, the security guards wouldn't let us stop work!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P504939887" "My contacts have been reporting some alarming statistics about Crey's Paragon Protectors. It seems they're getting stronger, tougher, and faster. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to see what you can dig up on these new, improved Paragon Protectors.</A> We need to know how to combat them."
// AcceptString :
"P592904047" "See what you can dig up on the new, improved Paragon Protectors"
// SendOffString :
"P3075034991" "I have to warn you, this probably won't be easy. From what I understand, the Protectors have gotten really tough."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3867386918" "If Crey has some new method of improving the Paragon Protectors, we need to know about it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1647994810" "A long, hopeless wail takes you by surprise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2940457162" "A few fatalities are to be expected."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2492082597" "Of course. The countess wants work to continue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3530341284" "Security breach!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3272417076" "Do whatever you have to do to keep the staff in line."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4262229902" "Understood."

