// ModelDisplayName :
"P1589432003" "Crey scientist"
// Description :
"P4245099803" "scientists to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P159809516" "Save the last scientist!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2099977098" "It was horrible! They made us do it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3614303664" "They would have sacrificed our lives!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1995756817" "Now I know why I get hazard pay!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2598646476" "You learned the secret of the improved Paragon Protectors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2482226646" "Ugh, {HeroName}, I think I'm going to be sick. The Crey higher-ups knew that the Rikti technology was booby trapped, but they made their scientists keep working on it anyway? It's hard to know how to fight an enemy who doesn't even value the lives of its own men."
// RandomFameString :
"P1868285908" "Thanks to {HeroName}, my best friend quit Crey for good!"

