// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Article 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2567851755" "Notes on Crey products"
// DetailString :
"P2345442079" "These notes on Crey-manufactured products date back several years. Although the majority of the ratings are positive, Crey products routinely scored low marks for customer safety. These findings have never made it to the pages of The Paragon Consumer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ReporterStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2131917971" "Sam Perry's story"
// DetailString :
"P3779695202" "After you rescued the editor of The Paragon Consumer, he told you:<br><br>'Look, Crey's been on our case for years. I guess I've always knuckled under to them, because I didn't want to spend my life's savings fighting off their lawyers. But this time they've gone too far! If I didn't report that their new stovetop has the consistency of a B horror movie, what would I look like?'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3927592838" "{HeroName}, I need you to get over to the offices of The Paragon Consumer right away! Their editor just called in a panic. Crey security forces have broken in, and they're terrorizing everybody inside! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I don't know what this is about, but I need you to protect that magazine from the cruel fist of Crey.</A> You only have 1 hour to deal with the situation."
// AcceptString :
"P201380942" "Protect the magazine office from Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P3391011538" "The Paragon Consumer writes some scathing consumer reports, but I've never seen them breathe a word against Crey. What could this be about?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2396695887" "Defeat all forces in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2720859282" "I need you to protect those reporters from the Crey security forces!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2840485192" "The Paragon Consumer is found on the coffee tables of many Paragon citizens."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1896413448" "The chief wants every last file searched."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P441112955" "Can do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2526415758" "I hear the editor of this rag finally grew a spine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P854336052" "Wasn't too bright of him, eh?"

