"P3328971987" "Sam Perry, editor"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1536387447" "I'll tell you what started this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P331267004" "File cabinet"
// Description :
"P552412236" "Investigate raid"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2474685944" "You begin searching the files."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2410028964" "You have searched the files."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P328140744" "You found some notes on Crey products."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - XtraFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1297737696" "You found some notes on countertop stain resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - MoreFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1515131348" "You found some notes on trash bag resilience."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - XtraFiles2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2972027165" "You found some notes on women's jeans shrinkage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P529230920" "You rescued The Paragon Consumer's office from the Crey forces."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P50251190" "You failed to prevent the Crey forces from ransacking the magazine's files."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3527733764" "So, Crey has been pressuring Perry to print only glowing reviews of their products for years, huh? And when he finally decided to stand up for himself, they trashed his office to teach him a lesson. The good news is, we kept that magazine office intact. The bad news is, Perry may be out of a job anyway. Libel charges were just filed against him in federal court. Oh, Crey isn't the plaintiff, but I suspect they're pulling the strings. I'll do what I can to protect him, but it looks like The Paragon Consumer may soon be under new management."
// RandomFameString :
"P354675826" "Did you hear there was a break-in at The Paragon Consumer? Crey security cleaned it up, but the bad guys got away!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3991862106" "Those reporters weren't hurt, but they sure got a good scare. According to the editor, Sam Perry, The Paragon Consumer has been knuckling under to Crey pressure for years. They finally decided to stand up and print an honest article, Crey was ready to apply the thumbscrews. It looks like the media in this town is completely under Countess Crey's milky white thumb."
// RandomFameString :
"P2390790391" "Did you hear {HeroName} went up against Crey security? Why would anyone do a thing like that?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2416577258" "I just got word that Crey is ransacking my lab! I don't understand this at all. I've worked so hard to keep that lab's location a secret. Only a few of my most trusted associates know where it is. People like you, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you please get over to my lab and try to keep it in one piece?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P716864166" "Try to keep {ContactName}'s lab in one piece"
// SendOffString :
"P3317525688" "I've got a lot of important data about various villain groups in that lab. I'd hate to see what Crey could do with that info!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1296630556" "Defeat all agents in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P541293632" "Have you cleared those Crey out of my lab?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1854265484" "A voice remarks, '{HeroName} always liked this place.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P940776380" "This place is a gold mine!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1115286770" "Yeah, {HeroName}'s memories have been pretty useful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2365025712" "Ah, {HeroName}! We meet at last!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1825893627" "I remember this place so well!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2603886597" "I know everything you know!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3723843097" "You prevented the Crey forces from ransacking {ContactName}'s lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2114792442" "Thanks for rescuing my lab from those Crey goons, {HeroName}. I can understand if you're a little shaken by what you've learned. It sounds like the countess managed to get her hands on your memories, for use in her diabolical Revenant Hero Project. That means that there are Paragon Protectors out there who know everything you know. In a way, they're kind of like copies of yourself. Except that they're totally devoted to the countess."
// RandomFameString :
"P1224384846" "Why does {HeroName} look so shaken up lately?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Formula 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P283881541" "Sample of Crey Cola formula"
// DetailString :
"P3458425820" "You took this sample from a Crey bottling company."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StudiedFormula 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P954293621" "This cola formula, analyzed by Dr. Steven Sheridan, contains a number of tiny machines called nanites. They're programmed to collect genetic information from their host, then transmit it to Crey by radio signal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2890344312" "Have you heard about this new Crey Cola that's going to be on the market soon? Well, I was watching a commercial for it last night, and I felt like I just had to try it! That's when I got suspicious. I had a friend take a look at Crey's advertising, and it turns out they're using subliminal messages to push this soda. I know Crey's competitive, but my gut tells me there's more here than cutthroat capitalism. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get a sample of Crey Cola and get it to Dr. Steven Sheridan.</A> He'll be able to analyze it."
// AcceptString :
"P551886801" "Get a sample of the Crey Cola formula"
// SendOffString :
"P19106298" "Crey has its fingers in just about every industry in this town. It gives the countess a lot of power, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2442801105" "Defeat security chief & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1437738155" "I'll bet my life there's something nefarious behind Crey Cola, but I need you to prove it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1969966936" "Colorful posters tacked to the wall advertise the forthcoming Crey Cola product."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Vat 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3115503954" "Cola formula"
// Description :
"P1572957216" "Get sample of Crey Cola"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1126334703" "You begin taking a sample."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3450757417" "You have taken a sample."
// InteractActionString :
"P1927321194" "Taking sample..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1568327505" "You got a sample of the Crey Cola formula!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3004144494" "You defeated the Crey security and found a sample of the formula used to make Crey Cola."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P226852465" "Take formula to Dr. Sheridan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3792841803" "Dr. Sheridan will know how to analyze that formula."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3100600634" "That's the one with the formula!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1377696226" "My word! This formula is about 90% sugar, 9% artificial coloring, and 1% nanite! You've heard of nanites, right, {HeroName}? Tiny machines small enough to float around in the bloodstream? These are set to collect genetic information from the host, then transmit it back to Crey by radio signal. If this product makes it to market, Crey will have genetic data on every Paragon citizen, including our most powerful heroes! {HeroName}, you've got to make this information public!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P743937735" "Dr. Sheridan called me, and I've got the word out to every media outlet in the city. Wouldn't you know it, Crey got to them first, and they're not reporting the whole story. They're simply saying that the Crey Cola product is being pulled, pending further studies by the FDA. At least you and I know the truth, {HeroName}. You saved the entire city from having their genetic data on file in some Crey lab."
// RandomFameString :
"P1823262505" "I was looking forward to trying Crey Cola, but I guess they scrubbed that product."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Sample 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P884797359" "DNA samples"
// DetailString :
"P2475005867" "One of the Crey agents you defeated was carrying several vials, each containing a sample of skin and labeled with the name of a famous hero. One vial is even labeled '{HeroName}.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2282498807" "I've got an important mission for you, {HeroName}. We know that Crey's Paragon Protectors have been cobbled together using the DNA and memories of real heroes. What we don't know is which heroes were used. That information could give us valuable insight into the Protectors' strengths and weaknesses. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you get us some samples of Paragon Protector DNA?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P73471587" "Get some samples of Paragon Protector DNA"
// SendOffString :
"P13358849" "You can go to the source, the Paragon Protectors. Or you can see if any of the other Crey agents have the required information. You ought to be able to find one or the other in the Rikti War Zone. They're always there, searching for Rikti technology to steal."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3246935136" "Get Paragon Protector DNA"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2226379627" "We need to know more about the Paragon Protectors' DNA!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P938216600" "That's {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P425291527" "You found some skin samples."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P104546979" "These skin samples you found can tell us a lot about the DNA that's been used to construct the Paragon Protectors. Good work, {HeroName}. I had feared that Crey might have acquired your DNA during one of your missions against them; I'm sorry to see I was correct."
// RandomFameString :
"P140183756" "I saw {HeroName} laying a beat down on Crey earlier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2475735260" "I've been hearing reports of Crey setting up illegal surveillance equipment over in the Rikti War Zone. My guess is that they want to record the peacekeeping activities of heroes like yourself. If they can get a better idea of your habits and weaknesses, they could use that information against you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to the Rikti War Zone and stop the Crey surveillance.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3329919116" "Go to the Rikti War Zone and stop the Crey surveillance"
// SendOffString :
"P3928669855" "With great knowledge comes great power. That's what makes Crey such a formidable opponent. You should try looking for them near Point du Hoc or the Sunken Road."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2384891162" "Combat Crey in Rikti War Zone"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2264081812" "My sources tell me that Crey's illegal surveillance equipment is still in place. I guess they haven't got the message."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2270153814" "You can't tell Crey what to do!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3374787378" "You have discouraged the Crey agents from conducting illegal surveillance in the Rikti War Zone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P352784449" "Good work, {HeroName}. Crey will think twice about spying on others, now that they know you're keeping an eye on them."
// RandomFameString :
"P2965629322" "I heard about {HeroName} busting some Crey tail over in the Rikti War Zone!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P866053132" "According to my sources, Crey agents have been dumping hazardous chemicals by the truckload in the Rikti War Zone. We'll never clean up that zone if these shenanigans continue. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to the Rikti War Zone and show Crey that it isn't their own private landfill.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2951383289" "Go to the Rikti War Zone and stop Crey pollution"
// SendOffString :
"P429290304" "Crey has a long history of skirting anti-pollution laws. They've fone a lot of damage near the Sunken road and Point du Hoc; you might want to start in those areas."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1566870129" "My sources tell me that those Crey agents are still dumping toxic waste in the Rikti War Zone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P888189210" "This is our place!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P862443172" "You don't belong!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1364180802" "You discouraged Crey from polluting the Rikti War Zone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3893122362" "Thanks for taking care of that pollution problem. Crey has never been a stickler for environmental regulations, but I think you convinced them to clean up their act."
// RandomFameString :
"P1640687325" "I hear Crey is getting tough on pollution."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Crey_Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P568895809" "I've received a frightening tip, {HeroName}. According to my source, Crey has managed to get its hands on several of those Rikti monkey pests that are such a nuisance on Peregrine Island. They're working on a way to bioengineer the little beasties for themselves! We can't have that. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get to this lab and get the Rikti monkeys out of there. </A> That's right. Every last one!"
// AcceptString :
"P2089877469" "Get the Rikti monkeys"
// SendOffString :
"P809592303" "My source tells me Crey's been trying to enhance the intelligence and reasoning of these creatures. I'm not really sure what you should expect."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2826110089" "Retrieve all three Rikti monkeys"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3530041180" "In the hands of the Countess, those Rikti creatures are even more dangerous. We need to get them out of there!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P583027474" "A high-pitched hooting ricochets down the metal corridors."

