// Dialog :
"P2106167739" "You have retrieved the Rikti monkeys."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1728305029" "I must say, I wasn't ready for this, {HeroName}. After hearing your report, I had SERAPH run a few tests. It seems these Rikti monkeys aren't just physically enhanced, but mentally as well! They're not what you might call sentient, but they're fairly intelligent. That must be how they identified you as an ally. <br><br>The monkeys will remain at SERAPH for now, though I've been assured they'll be treated well. It's a strange world, {HeroName}. Sometimes a very strange world indeed."
// RandomFameString :
"P1182410022" "Did I hear right? {HeroName} saved some Rikti monkeys?"
